        {
          "#text": "Polyurethane foam; Flexible polyurethane foam; FPF",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "聚氨酯泡沫；软质聚氨酯泡沫；软质聚氨酯泡沫（FPF）",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Polyfoam is the abbreviated term for polyurethane foam, sometimes called flexible polyurethane foam (FPF), per the Polyurethane Foam Association (PFA). It has been around since 1937 and has become quite popular for its ability to provide cushioning. It is a rigid, semirigid, or rubbery foam composed of minute bubbles of air or carbon dioxide embedded in a polymer matrix, often polyurethane. It is used in mattresses, padding, insulation, etc. Polyurethane foam, also known as polyfoam, is one of the most used bedding materials.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "Polyfoam 是聚氨酯泡沫塑料的缩写，聚氨酯泡沫塑料协会（PFA）称其为软质聚氨酯泡沫塑料（FPF）。它从 1937 年开始出现，因其缓冲能力而颇受欢迎。它是一种硬质、半硬质或橡胶泡沫，由嵌入聚合物基质（通常是聚氨酯）中的微小气泡或二氧化碳组成。它可用于床垫、衬垫、隔热材料等。聚氨酯泡沫又称聚泡沫塑料，是最常用的床上用品材料之一。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
